    "summary": "Model eligibility. **THOUSAND SONS**. In a [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) you take, you may use this once in a battle if the bearer’s unit is unengaged. Send it to [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves) and give it [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-rule/deep-strike). The grant expires when you next start a [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase). It must return by [Ingress Move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move) in the [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) you take next, even on your first turn.",
